    "name":  "LED Candle Bulb 6W E14 C37 180º - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835",
    "reference":  "C376WOSR-CW-90129",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eNew generation of \u003cstrong\u003eE14 6W LED candle lamps\u003c/strong\u003e with 2835 SMD diode with \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM\u003c/strong\u003e 150Lm/W High Luminosity Chip and \u003cstrong\u003eDriver NO Flick\u003c/strong\u003e. The \u003cstrong\u003ebulb\u003c/strong\u003e has a 3 year guarantee. Savings of up to 80% replacing traditional halogens, offering a large light beam with its \u003cstrong\u003e180º\u003c/strong\u003e opening and high quality.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2 style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003eLED Candle Bulb 6W E14 C37 180º - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur \u003cstrong\u003eE14 LED candle bulb\u003c/strong\u003e with \u003cstrong\u003e6W\u003c/strong\u003e of power, achieves energy savings of up to 80% which makes it a very environmentally friendly product that also offers an instant start and a long life.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eOSRAM Chip\u003c/strong\u003e SMD 2835 High Lumens diodes provide equivalent luminosity to a conventional light bulb of around 50W. This results in energy savings of 80%. The exposed light is distributed at an angle of \u003cstrong\u003e180º\u003c/strong\u003e and has a colour rendering index of +80, which is indicative of the quality of light delivered by our \u003cstrong\u003e6W E14 C37 LED bulb.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBeyond the energy efficiency, this type of lighting stands out for its long life estimated at 25,000 hours. This is due to the quality of the materials, such as the aluminium and the polycarbonate used.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRefresh the lighting of any space with the \u003cstrong\u003eE14 C37 6W LED bulb\u003c/strong\u003e from our online lighting shop.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications of the LED Candle Bulb 6W E14 C37 180º - OSRAM CHIP DURIS E 2835\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePhotography Shops\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePhotomatons\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003edwelling\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesign galleries\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDesk, table, pendant or floor lamps\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://www.factorled.com/img/cms/the-interior-of-the-3682654_960_720.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"540\" /\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
